{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-backpressure-queue-retry","title":"水平扩展、背压队列与重试机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/scale-operations-observability/scaling-backpressure-queue-retry","wordCount":2899,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"水平扩展-背压队列与重试机制\">水平扩展、背压队列与重试机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-三处缓冲-一条背压链\">核心概念：三处缓冲、一条背压链</h2><p>Collector 处理遥测的方式不是「要么立刻送达、要么立刻丢」，而是经过三处可以吸收突发的位置：管道入口的 <code>memory_limiter</code> processor 对进程内存设硬线，超线即拒绝新数据；exporter 的 <code>sending_queue</code> 把「下游暂时收不下」转成「先在本地排队」；<code>retry_on_failure</code> 决定排完队仍失败的数据重试多久、何时认输。三者串成一条背压链，而链上每一跳的溢出行为不同——这决定了超载时数据是<strong>被拒</strong>、<strong>被缓冲</strong>还是<strong>被静默丢弃</strong>。</p>\n<p>分清「拒绝」与「丢弃」是整个主题的分水岭。拒绝有信号：接收端返回错误，上游看得见、能重试、能计数。丢弃没有信号：数据在某一跳因超时被清掉，链路两端都只看到「一切正常」。真正致命的是后者，而它恰恰是排队数据在重试预算耗尽后的默认结局。本文按这条链自下而上拆解：先看队列的容量语义，再看退避参数，然后看背压如何上行、实例如何横向扩张，最后落到容量估算与告警口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sending_queue-容量-消费者与两级溢出\">sending_queue：容量、消费者与两级溢出</h2><p><code>sending_queue</code> 是 exporterhelper 提供的通用发送队列，所有建立在它之上的 exporter（<code>otlp</code>、<code>otlphttp</code>、<code>kafka</code> 等）共享同一套参数（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/blob/main/exporter/exporterhelper/README.md\"><code>exporter/exporterhelper/README.md</code></a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>enabled</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>是否启用队列；关闭则每次导出同步阻塞上游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num_consumers</code></td>\n<td><code>10</code></td>\n<td>并发发送协程数，决定单实例出口吞吐上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>queue_size</code></td>\n<td><code>1000</code></td>\n<td>队列能容纳的<strong>批数</strong>，非记录数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sizer</code></td>\n<td><code>requests</code></td>\n<td>计量单位；<code>items</code> 改为按 span / 数据点 / 日志条计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>block_on_overflow</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>队列满时：<code>false</code> 立即报错返回，<code>true</code> 阻塞生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>storage</code></td>\n<td>空</td>\n<td>填入 storage extension（如 <code>file_storage</code>）即启用持久化队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>queue_size</code> 的单位是运维上最常被误读的一处：它数的是<strong>批</strong>。真正的在途记录数上界近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext>queue_size</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>num_consumers</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} \\approx \\text{queue\\_size} \\times S_{\\text{batch}} \\times (1 + \\text{num\\_consumers})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num_consumers</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <code>batch</code> processor 的 <code>send_batch_max_size</code>。按默认 <code>queue_size: 1000</code>、<code>num_consumers: 10</code>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8192</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{batch}} = 8192</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8192</span></span></span></span></span>，单实例最坏情形要持有近 <strong>900 万条</strong> span，且尚未计入 <code>pdata</code> 转 proto 时的序列化副本。这就是「队列缓冲区」与「进程 RSS」之间的换算关系，也是 <code>memory_limiter</code> 必须排在管道最前面的原因（processor 的首尾定序见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../processing-extension-custom/processor-family-semantics-order\">processor 族语义与执行顺序</a>）。</p>\n<p><code>block_on_overflow</code> 决定溢出姿态：默认 <code>false</code> 时，塞不进去的批<strong>立刻失败并递增 <code>otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_&lt;signal&gt;</code></strong>，上游紧接着看到拒绝；改成 <code>true</code> 则生产者被挂起，背压以「接收变慢」而非「报错」的形式上行。合规采集场景（例如需要完整订单审计链路）通常选 <code>true</code>，代价是下游长时间不可用时整条管道被拖慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"背压如何一路上行\">背压如何一路上行</h2><p>把三处缓冲连起来看，超载的传播路径是确定的：下游变慢使队列变长，队列满触发阻塞或拒绝，拒绝经 receiver 返回给客户端，客户端按服务端给的延迟提示退避重放。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户端 SDK&lt;br/&gt;批量导出] --&gt; B{receiver 接收}&#10;  B --&gt;|接收成功| C{memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;是否超过硬线}&#10;  C --&gt;|超过| D[拒绝新数据&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_processor_refused]&#10;  C --&gt;|线内| E[processor 链&lt;br/&gt;过滤 / 采样 / 转换]&#10;  E --&gt; F{exporter 入队}&#10;  F --&gt;|队列未满| G[sending_queue&lt;br/&gt;num_consumers 并发发送]&#10;  F --&gt;|已满 且 block_on_overflow=false| H[立即报错&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed]&#10;  F --&gt;|已满 且 block_on_overflow=true| I[阻塞生产者&lt;br/&gt;背压转为延迟上行]&#10;  G --&gt; J{下游是否接受}&#10;  J --&gt;|可重试错误| K[指数退避重放&lt;br/&gt;5s 起 1.5 倍 30s 封顶]&#10;  K --&gt;|预算内成功| L[发送完成]&#10;  K --&gt;|超过 max_elapsed_time| M[丢弃并计数&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_exporter_send_failed]&#10;  J --&gt;|不可重试错误| M&#10;  H --&gt; N[上游 receiver 拒绝客户端]&#10;  I --&gt; N&#10;  N --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户端 SDK&lt;br/&gt;批量导出] --&gt; B{receiver 接收}\n  B --&gt;|接收成功| C{memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;是否超过硬线}\n  C --&gt;|超过| D[拒绝新数据&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_processor_refused]\n  C --&gt;|线内| E[processor 链&lt;br/&gt;过滤 / 采样 / 转换]\n  E --&gt; F{exporter 入队}\n  F --&gt;|队列未满| G[sending_queue&lt;br/&gt;num_consumers 并发发送]\n  F --&gt;|已满 且 block_on_overflow=false| H[立即报错&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed]\n  F --&gt;|已满 且 block_on_overflow=true| I[阻塞生产者&lt;br/&gt;背压转为延迟上行]\n  G --&gt; J{下游是否接受}\n  J --&gt;|可重试错误| K[指数退避重放&lt;br/&gt;5s 起 1.5 倍 30s 封顶]\n  K --&gt;|预算内成功| L[发送完成]\n  K --&gt;|超过 max_elapsed_time| M[丢弃并计数&lt;br/&gt;otelcol_exporter_send_failed]\n  J --&gt;|不可重试错误| M\n  H --&gt; N[上游 receiver 拒绝客户端]\n  I --&gt; N\n  N --&gt; A</pre><p>图中只有 <code>M</code> 是真正不可恢复的丢失点。<code>D</code> 与 <code>H</code> 都把决定权交回上游，上游（无论是 SDK 还是上一跳 Collector）仍有重试机会；<code>M</code> 则是队列里的批在预算耗尽后被清掉，除了指标之外没有任何外部信号。想在设计上消除 <code>M</code>，只能靠扩大 <code>max_elapsed_time</code>、扩大队列、或启用持久化存储三选一或组合，而没有「既不占内存又不丢」的选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"retry_on_failure-退避参数与重试时间预算\">retry_on_failure：退避参数与重试时间预算</h2><p>重试只对<strong>可重试错误</strong>生效，分类规则由 OTLP 规范按状态码钉死：HTTP 仅 <code>429</code> / <code>502</code> / <code>503</code> / <code>504</code>、gRPC 仅 <code>UNAVAILABLE</code> / <code>DEADLINE_EXCEEDED</code> / <code>ABORTED</code> / <code>OUT_OF_RANGE</code> / <code>CANCELLED</code> / <code>DATA_LOSS</code> 可重试，<code>RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED</code> 只有附带 <code>RetryInfo</code> 详情时才可重试（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto/blob/main/docs/specification.md\">OTLP 规范</a> 的 Retry 与 Throttling 节；逐条分类见 <a href=\"../otlp-protocol-data-model/otlp-receiver-batch-partial-success\">OTLP receiver 接收路径与 partial success</a>）。<code>INVALID_ARGUMENT</code> 这类永久性错误不重试，直接计失败——对确定性坏数据反复重放，只会把一次数据质量问题放大成对下游的持续压测。</p>\n<p>可重试错误按指数退避加抖动重放（来源：<code>exporter/exporterhelper/README.md</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>initial</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min\\left(t_{\\text{initial}} \\cdot m^{\\,n-1},\\; t_{\\max}\\right) \\cdot U(1-r,\\; 1+r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">initial</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是区间上的均匀随机数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动因子。各参数与默认值如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>initial_interval</code></td>\n<td><code>5s</code></td>\n<td>首次重试等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>multiplier</code></td>\n<td><code>1.5</code></td>\n<td>每次等待的放大系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_interval</code></td>\n<td><code>30s</code></td>\n<td>单次等待上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>randomization_factor</code></td>\n<td><code>0.5</code></td>\n<td>抖动范围，实际等待落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1.5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.5t,\\ 1.5t]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_elapsed_time</code></td>\n<td><code>5m</code></td>\n<td>从首次失败起的总预算；<code>0</code> 表示无限重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>代入默认值可算出等待序列约 <code>5s → 7.5s → 11.25s → 16.9s → 25.3s</code>，第 5 次之后被 <code>max_interval</code> 压到 <code>30s</code>；累计到 <code>300s</code> 预算耗尽时大约只跑了 <strong>13 次</strong>重试。这个数量级对容量规划很关键：一次下游故障若持续超过 5 分钟，超期那部分数据会被丢弃并计入 <code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_&lt;signal&gt;</code>。</p>\n<p>把 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 设成 <code>0</code>（无限重试）看起来能消除这个丢失点，但它把风险从「丢数据」换成了「内存无界」：数据长期留在队列里，<code>num_consumers</code> 可能全部阻塞在重试上，新数据只能从队列尾溢出。若要「一条不丢」，正确组合是<strong>有限的 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 加持久化队列</strong>，而不是无限重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持久化队列-跨重启不丢-但有吞吐代价\">持久化队列：跨重启不丢，但有吞吐代价</h2><p>给 <code>sending_queue.storage</code> 填一个 storage extension（最常用 <code>file_storage</code>）后，入队的批先落盘再发送，进程重启或 Pod 重建后从磁盘续发（来源：<code>extension/storage/filestorage/README.md</code>）。这挡的是编排层无法避免的抖动：滚动更新、节点驱逐、HPA 缩容都会杀 Pod，而纯内存队列随 Pod 一起消失。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"extensions:&#10;  file_storage/queue:&#10;    directory: /var/lib/otelcol/queue&#10;    timeout: 1s&#10;    compaction:&#10;      on_start: true&#10;      on_rebound: true&#10;exporters:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    endpoint: gateway.observability.svc:4317&#10;    sending_queue:&#10;      storage: file_storage/queue&#10;      queue_size: 20000&#10;    retry_on_failure:&#10;      max_elapsed_time: 30m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  file_storage/queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    directory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/var/lib/otelcol/queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    compaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      on_start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      on_rebound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gateway.observability.svc:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sending_queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">file_storage/queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      queue_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    retry_on_failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_elapsed_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代价有两处。<strong>一是写入路径</strong>：每批入队都要落盘，<code>timeout</code> 控制文件锁等待，<code>compaction</code> 控制碎片整理时机；在写密集的采集节点上，磁盘 IOPS 会直接变成管道吞吐上限。<strong>二是扩容语义变了</strong>：持久化队列让 Pod 有了本地状态，滚动更新时若不做 <code>StatefulSet</code> 的稳定标识与卷继承，新 Pod 读不到旧队列文件，持久化就退化成「内存队列加一层磁盘写开销」。另外，收到 SIGTERM 后 Collector 会停止接收并尽量把队列里剩余的批发完，这个排空窗口受编排层 <code>terminationGracePeriodSeconds</code> 约束（Kubernetes 默认 30 秒）；若队列里的数据在 30 秒内发不完且下游持续不可用，剩余部分仍会随 Pod 一起消失——<code>terminationGracePeriodSeconds</code> 与 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 必须一起看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"水平扩展-分层拓扑与-traceid-亲和\">水平扩展：分层拓扑与 traceID 亲和</h2><p>Collector 水平扩展的标准做法是<strong>两层拓扑</strong>：agent 层（DaemonSet，每节点一个，就近采集并做 <code>memory_limiter</code> 与基础裁剪）与 gateway 层（Deployment 或 StatefulSet，负责采样、聚合与出口）（来源：<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/scaling/\">OpenTelemetry 官方文档 Scaling the Collector</a>）。agent 层随节点数自然扩展，真正需要水平伸缩判断的是 gateway 层。</p>\n<p>gateway 层前面若只放一个 k8s Service 做四层负载均衡，会发生一件事：<strong>同一条 trace 的 span 可能落到不同 gateway</strong>。对无状态处理无害，却会直接摧毁尾采样——<code>tail_sampling</code> processor 必须拿到一条完整 trace 的全部 span 才能决策，span 被拆散后每个 gateway 都只看到碎片，采样结果大面积错判。为此 Collector 提供 <code>loadbalancing</code> exporter，用一致性哈希把同一个 <code>traceID</code> 恒定路由到同一后端（来源：<code>exporter/loadbalancingexporter/README.md</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"exporters:&#10;  loadbalancing:&#10;    routing_key: traceID&#10;    protocol:&#10;      otlp:&#10;        tls: { insecure: true }&#10;    resolver:&#10;      k8s:&#10;        service: otel-gateway&#10;        ports: [4317]&#10;      # 或 dns:  { hostname: otel-gateway-headless.otel.svc.cluster.local, port: 4317 }&#10;      # 或 static: { hostnames: [10.0.0.1:4317, 10.0.0.2:4317] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  loadbalancing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">traceID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">insecure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resolver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      k8s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel-gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4317</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 或 dns:  { hostname: otel-gateway-headless.otel.svc.cluster.local, port: 4317 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 或 static: { hostnames: [10.0.0.1:4317, 10.0.0.2:4317] }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三种 resolver 的差异是运维面而非协议面的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>resolver</th>\n<th>后端发现方式</th>\n<th>适用与陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>static</code></td>\n<td>写死后端列表</td>\n<td>最简单；扩缩容要改配置并重启，只适合固定拓扑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dns</code></td>\n<td>解析 headless Service 的 A 记录，按 <code>interval</code> 重查</td>\n<td>后端变动后自动重建哈希环；依赖 DNS 解析频率与 TTL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>k8s</code></td>\n<td>监听 Endpoints / EndpointSlice</td>\n<td>变更最及时；需给 Collector 配 ServiceAccount 与读 endpoints 的 RBAC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>routing_key</code> 可取 <code>traceID</code>（用于 trace 与尾采样）或 <code>service</code>（按键值分组，适合按服务维度聚合的场景）。要注意<strong>哈希环重建是有代价的</strong>：后端增减会让部分 trace 的归属改变，落点迁移期间同一条 trace 的 span 仍可能被拆到不同实例。因此扩展 gateway 时优先<strong>多副本慢扩</strong>，并把 <code>dns.interval</code> 设得比 HPA 的伸缩频率更长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量估算-用-little-定律定队列与消费者\">容量估算：用 Little 定律定队列与消费者</h2><p>队列开多大、消费者开几个，可以用 Little 定律给出量级而不是凭感觉。对发送侧：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是稳态下队列与在途之中的批数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是入队速率（批/秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是单批从入队到发送完成的时间。不溢出需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>queue_size</mtext><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{queue\\_size} \\ge L_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；要抗住下游故障 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则需</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>queue_size</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{queue\\_size} \\ge \\lambda \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二个式子给出了「要不要上持久化队列」的判据。设某跨境电商站点峰值入队速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 批/秒、下游计划内维护窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>60000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200 \\times 300 = 60000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60000</span></span></span></span></span> 批的容量；按每批平均 4096 条 span、每条序列化后约 400 字节估算，光队列就要约 <strong>98 GB</strong> 内存，显然不可行——这时答案不是把内存开大，而是<strong>用持久化队列把容量换成磁盘</strong>，或者明确接受窗口内丢弃并把 <code>send_failed</code> 计数接入告警。<code>num_consumers</code> 的下界则由出口延迟倒推：单消费者每秒最多处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 批，跑满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\lambda W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 个消费者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自监控指标与告警口径\">自监控指标与告警口径</h2><p>Collector 自身遥测默认暴露在 <code>:8888/metrics</code>（Prometheus 拉取格式；较新版本改为在 <code>service.telemetry.metrics.readers</code> 下显式声明 pull exporter，地址可自定义）。判断「有没有丢数据」只需盯住几个计数器，且<strong>每个计数器对应链路上一个不同的失败点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>递增含义</th>\n<th>数据命运</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_receiver_refused_&lt;signal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>receiver 拒绝了上游</td>\n<td>上游需重试；可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_processor_refused_&lt;signal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>processor 拒绝（多为 <code>memory_limiter</code> 触发）</td>\n<td>上游需重试；可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_processor_dropped_&lt;signal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>processor 主动丢（采样、过滤）</td>\n<td>预期丢弃；非故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_&lt;signal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>队列满且 <code>block_on_overflow: false</code></td>\n<td>本次拒绝；上游可重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_&lt;signal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>重试预算 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 耗尽</td>\n<td><strong>永久丢失</strong>；必须告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_queue_size</code> / <code>..._queue_capacity</code></td>\n<td>队列水位</td>\n<td>饱和前兆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此得出两条告警口径。<strong>丢失告警</strong>：<code>rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_&lt;signal&gt;[5m]) &gt; 0</code> 是唯一代表不可恢复丢失的信号，应做分页级告警；<code>enqueue_failed</code> 递增说明背压已经打到队列口，值得告警但优先级次之，因为它仍可恢复。<strong>饱和告警</strong>：用 <code>otelcol_exporter_queue_size / otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity</code> 持续高于阈值（例如 0.8 维持 5 分钟）触发扩容，比基于 CPU 的 HPA 更贴合 Collector 的真实瓶颈——Collector 的开销大头是序列化、压缩与网络等待，队列已经打满时 CPU 利用率常常仍不高，用 CPU 触发扩容会慢半拍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>管道有三处缓冲、一条背压链：<code>memory_limiter</code> → <code>sending_queue</code> → <code>retry_on_failure</code> → 上游 receiver → 客户端退避。</li>\n<li><code>queue_size</code> 数的是<strong>批</strong>不是记录，内存上界近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>queue_size</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>num_consumers</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{queue\\_size} \\times S_{\\text{batch}} \\times (1 + \\text{num\\_consumers})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num_consumers</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，必须与 <code>memory_limiter</code> 配合。</li>\n<li><code>block_on_overflow</code> 决定溢出是「阻塞」还是「报错返回」；合规采集选阻塞，代价是下游故障会拖慢整条链。</li>\n<li>退避默认 <code>5s</code> 起点、<code>1.5</code> 倍增幅、<code>30s</code> 封顶、<code>5m</code> 预算，约 13 次重试后放弃；<code>max_elapsed_time: 0</code> 是把丢失风险换成内存无界，不是更安全。</li>\n<li>持久化队列用磁盘换容量，但要接受落盘 IOPS 上限与 StatefulSet + PVC 的编排约束，并让 <code>terminationGracePeriodSeconds</code> 与 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 相匹配。</li>\n<li>水平扩展走 agent / gateway 分层；gateway 要用 <code>tail_sampling</code> 就必须用 <code>loadbalancing</code> exporter 按 <code>traceID</code> 做一致性哈希，四层轮询会拆散 trace。</li>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>queue_size</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{queue\\_size} \\ge \\lambda T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 判断是否需要持久化；用 <code>send_failed</code> 与队列水位两条指标分别驱动丢失告警与扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文引用的默认值取自 Collector 仓库 README 与 OTLP 规范，这些默认值会随发行版变动，落地前应以所部署版本的 <code>README.md</code> 与 <code>--help</code> 输出为准复验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水平扩展、背压队列与重试机制","id":"水平扩展-背压队列与重试机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三处缓冲、一条背压链","id":"核心概念-三处缓冲-一条背压链"},{"level":2,"text":"sending_queue：容量、消费者与两级溢出","id":"sending_queue-容量-消费者与两级溢出"},{"level":2,"text":"背压如何一路上行","id":"背压如何一路上行"},{"level":2,"text":"retry_on_failure：退避参数与重试时间预算","id":"retry_on_failure-退避参数与重试时间预算"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化队列：跨重启不丢，但有吞吐代价","id":"持久化队列-跨重启不丢-但有吞吐代价"},{"level":2,"text":"水平扩展：分层拓扑与 traceID 亲和","id":"水平扩展-分层拓扑与-traceid-亲和"},{"level":2,"text":"容量估算：用 Little 定律定队列与消费者","id":"容量估算-用-little-定律定队列与消费者"},{"level":2,"text":"自监控指标与告警口径","id":"自监控指标与告警口径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"agent / gateway 部署拓扑与多级路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/scale-operations-observability/agent-gateway-deployment-topology"},"next":{"title":"collector 自监控、故障排查与滚动升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/scale-operations-observability/self-observability-troubleshooting-upgrade"}}